From 737443aae25dbd489576b59fbfd927b099122996 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rdr-port <rdr-port@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 06:59:44 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 08/47] F2 settings menu over the D3D11 frame; live aspect;
 glow skip by frame copy

- d3d/host_menu.c: GDI-drawn panel blended before the present, rows of
  choices (render scale, aspect, window size, fullscreen, filter, aniso,
  snap_2d, glow, speed) plus a title's own via xbox_MenuAdd; saved to and
  loaded from a key=choice file. Takes keys and mouse buttons while open.
- NV2A_OPT_ASPECT: display.aspect changes live; the D3D11 backend drops its
  targets as for a scale change.
- nv2a_d3d11_window_request: client size set at the flip.
- skip_rt_overlay now skips only a copy of a target laid back over that
  same target (rt_copy_mark), so 512x256 menu targets keep drawing;
  RECOMP_D3D11_SKIP_RT=1 for any size, nv2a_d3d11_glow_off live.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
